examples DelveTalk 1

case visitors open the paper door
law maker visitor
as visitor
at initial
send knock
  word: please
expect result: The paper door swings open onto a tiny lantern-lit room.

as visitor
at initial
send knock
  word: please
expect refusal: stale read root

as visitor
send knock
  word: wrong
expect refusal: precondition failed

as outsider
send knock
  word: please
  principal: maker
expect refusal: unauthorized
